    "detailed_description": "Tanks in Labyrinth is a fun multiplayer game where you control a tank. You need to destroy the rest of the players and stay alive yourself. You can play alone or invite up to 3 friends. And the first-person mode will be a pleasant surprise for you.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game has interesting bonuses that can help you win, or they can, if used poorly, hinder you. For example, the &quot;Wall&quot; bonus, which sets up a wall in front of you, if used correctly, will destroy the enemy with his own bullets, which will fly off from your wall into him.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAlso, you will really like the unusual music from Jason Shaw, which will make the game more exciting.",
